[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 424.71, "timestamp": "00:07:04", "text": "一切順利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 427.67, "timestamp": "00:07:07", "text": "是的，你今天上場。找份工作。它怎麼樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 430.07, "timestamp": "00:07:10", "text": "？  它怎麼樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 433.99, "timestamp": "00:07:13", "text": "？權力如何？  是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 437.749, "timestamp": "00:07:17", "text": "啊，P 真有趣。我之前沒意識到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 440.71, "timestamp": "00:07:20", "text": "。不過，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 443.83, "timestamp": "00:07:23", "text": "通常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 447.909, "timestamp": "00:07:27", "text": "很難適應新遊戲，但這款遊戲"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 451.189, "timestamp": "00:07:31", "text": "有點像，你知道，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 454.469, "timestamp": "00:07:34", "text": "我們上次一起玩的那款遊戲一樣。  是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 458.71, "timestamp": "00:07:38", "text": "這就是為什麼我玩得很開心，而且很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 462.15, "timestamp": "00:07:42", "text": "容易適應的原因。  真的很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 465.67, "timestamp": "00:07:45", "text": "有趣。這讓我想起了我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 469.029, "timestamp": "00:07:49", "text": "剛剛打開的東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 471.909, "timestamp": "00:07:51", "text": "啊，你來了。你好。  你好。哇"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 475.83, "timestamp": "00:07:55", "text": "。等待。如何？哦，你穿的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 478.23, "timestamp": "00:07:58", "text": "平常的衣服。好的。"}]